{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“单纯局部化”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"单纯局部化"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>标准单纯局部化</h3>\n<p>设 $U\\colon \\mathsf {Cat} \\to \\mathsf {Graph}$ 将小范畴对应到其底层无向图. 函子 $U$ 有左伴随 $F\\colon \\mathsf {Graph}\\to\\mathsf {Cat}$. 于是我们得到 $\\mathsf {Cat}$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"余单子","text":"余单子"}},{"Plain":" $(G,\\varepsilon,\\delta)$.</p>\n"}]}}